08207350 vulcan-facing-turn-return

On the unfinished animation path the inlined step uses r1 through r7.
The incoming p remains in r0 through 082074A0.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/monsters/cannons/vulcan/VulcanCannon_UpdateFacingTurn.c
+++ b/src/monsters/cannons/vulcan/VulcanCannon_UpdateFacingTurn.c
@@ -21,3 +21,6 @@
         return Anim_RestartSequence(&p->sequence, p->resource, 0x11, (u8)p->facing, loop = 0);
     }
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return (s32)p; // preserve the inherited GBA return value
+#endif
 }
